==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the high stats of the Jackie Pengs, this stage can be easily cleared by using [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] to attack and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to defend.

